<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-7-intro">
  <title>Week 7</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      At the end of this week you should be able to...
    </p>
    <objectives>
      <ul>
        <li>trace the flow of control during the execution of a program using for and do-while loops</li>
        <li>develop programs that use loops to iterate through strings</li>
        <li>identify type errors resulting from return types and parameter types in static method definitions</li>
        <li>write javadoc comments explaining what a method does</li>
      </ul>
